      <iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal">
        <translations>
          <translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="en">
            <text for="L1">The unfinished heartbeat veils the night</text>
            <text for="L2">Before it all shatters, wrapping us tight</text>
            <text for="L3">That hand — frail and unsure is just fine</text>
            <text for="L4">This hand, after all, is yours and mine</text>
            <text for="L5">Nothing ever stays the same — reach out your hand</text>
            <text for="L6">Amid the crowd, I wept in silence</text>
            <text for="L7">Footprints fade a voice in the morning&apos;s quiet</text>
            <text for="L8">Never withering through endless days</text>
            <text for="L9">The rotten city&apos;s mudwater runs cold</text>
            <text for="L10">In a world that never changes</text>
            <text for="L11">Still we scrape through another day</text>
            <text for="L12">Pointless, yet what can we do anyway</text>
            <text for="L13">We&apos;ve already started walking on</text>
            <text for="L14">Unbelievable, like goddamn fools</text>
            <text for="L15">This hopeless city of ours</text>
            <text for="L16">Even so, I saw it clear with these eyes</text>
            <text for="L17">Felt it real with these hands — hey, look, look</text>
            <text for="L18">There you go again, spouting like a fool</text>
            <text for="L19">Lighting up the impenetrable dark</text>
            <text for="L20">It&apos;s no dream — even if the city&apos;s already wrecked</text>
            <text for="L21">Giving up won&apos;t change a damn thing — ah, not yet, not yet, not yet</text>
            <text for="L22">The unfinished heartbeat veils the night</text>
            <text for="L23">Before it all shatters, wrapping us tight</text>
            <text for="L24">That hand — frail and unsure is just fine</text>
            <text for="L25">This hand, after all, is yours and mine</text>
            <text for="L26">Nothing ever stays the same — reach out your hand</text>
            <text for="L27">In eternity, a warmth to keep from losing my way</text>
            <text for="L28">Scattering, never reaching your shallow heart</text>
            <text for="L29">Just as you imagined? No way that&apos;s true</text>
            <text for="L30">Just run away, right? Don&apos;t say it so lightly</text>
            <text for="L31">Through the world same as always</text>
            <text for="L32">We keep dashing on today</text>
            <text for="L33">If you slip and fall, I&apos;ll pull you up</text>
            <text for="L34">That gleam of blue shining inside the gray sky</text>
            <text for="L35">Unbelievable, like goddamn fools</text>
            <text for="L36">This hopeless city of ours</text>
            <text for="L37">Even so, I saw it clear with these eyes</text>
            <text for="L38">Felt it real with these hands — hey, look, look</text>
            <text for="L39">There you go again, spouting like a fool</text>
            <text for="L40">Lighting up the impenetrable dark</text>
            <text for="L41">It&apos;s no dream — even if the city&apos;s already wrecked</text>
            <text for="L42">Giving up won&apos;t change a damn thing — ah, not yet, not yet, not yet</text>
            <text for="L43">The unfinished heartbeat veils the night</text>
            <text for="L44">Before it all shatters, wrapping us tight</text>
            <text for="L45">That hand — frail and unsure is just fine</text>
            <text for="L46">This hand, after all, is yours and mine</text>
            <text for="L47">Nothing ever stays the same — reach out your hand</text>
            <text for="L48">Everything rests on you, and on me</text>
          </translation>
          <translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans">
            <text for="L1">未竟的心愿 覆盖了整片夜空</text>
            <text for="L2">化作齑粉之前 将我重重包裹</text>
            <text for="L3">这只手 哪怕不可靠也没关系</text>
            <text for="L4">毕竟 这是你自己的手</text>
            <text for="L5">唯一不变的就是变化 伸出你的手吧</text>
            <text for="L6">人来人往中 静静地哭出了声</text>
            <text for="L7">今天早上 又有谁的声音消失在足迹中</text>
            <text for="L8">历经悠久岁月 不见枯败</text>
            <text for="L9">腐败的街道 泥水寒冷刺骨</text>
            <text for="L10">这世界 一成不变</text>
            <text for="L11">今天也要 努力过活</text>
            <text for="L12">虽然无趣 亦无可奈何</text>
            <text for="L13">我们已经开始向前迈进</text>
            <text for="L14">难以置信 又愚不可及</text>
            <text for="L15">我们的街道 无可救药</text>
            <text for="L16">即便如此 也要亲眼见证</text>
            <text for="L17">来吧 来吧 亲手去触碰感受</text>
            <text for="L18">看你又说大话 不是天真就是傻</text>
            <text for="L19">深不可测的黑暗也想照亮</text>
            <text for="L20">这不是梦 反正街道已经完蛋</text>
            <text for="L21">自暴自弃也没好处 还不到放弃的时候</text>
            <text for="L22">未竟的心愿 覆盖了整片夜空</text>
            <text for="L23">化作齑粉之前 将我重重包裹</text>
            <text for="L24">这只手 哪怕不可靠也没关系</text>
            <text for="L25">毕竟 这是你自己的手</text>
            <text for="L26">唯一不变的就是变化 伸出你的手吧</text>
            <text for="L27">永恒之中 一份不致迷失的温热</text>
            <text for="L28">飘向浅薄的你 未曾抵达便散落殆尽</text>
            <text for="L29">如你所料？ 怎么可能</text>
            <text for="L30">逃跑就完事了？ 别说得那么轻巧</text>
            <text for="L31">一如既往的世界</text>
            <text for="L32">今天也要 奋力奔跑</text>
            <text for="L33">若你失足滑落 就由我来抓住</text>
            <text for="L34">灰色天空里 那一抹闪耀的蓝</text>
            <text for="L35">难以置信 又愚不可及</text>
            <text for="L36">我们的街道 无可救药</text>
            <text for="L37">即便如此 也要亲眼见证</text>
            <text for="L38">来吧 来吧 亲手去触碰感受</text>
            <text for="L39">看你又说大话 不是天真就是傻</text>
            <text for="L40">深不可测的黑暗也想照亮</text>
            <text for="L41">这不是梦 反正街道已经完蛋</text>
            <text for="L42">自暴自弃也没好处 还不到放弃的时候</text>
            <text for="L43">未竟的心愿 覆盖了整片夜空</text>
            <text for="L44">化作齑粉之前 将我重重包裹</text>
            <text for="L45">这只手 哪怕不可靠也没关系</text>
            <text for="L46">毕竟 这是你自己的手</text>
            <text for="L47">唯一不变的就是变化 伸出你的手吧</text>
            <text for="L48">万事皆由你 也皆由我</text>
          </translation>
        </translations>
